00:47:04.961 --> 00:47:06.722
not really knowing what to do with it.

00:47:07.562 --> 00:47:11.045
A number of projects have been undertaken,

00:47:12.106 --> 00:47:14.567
to turn it into an aquatic center,

00:47:14.568 --> 00:47:20.091
a training center for somewhat niche sports,

00:47:20.972 --> 00:47:22.433
like the crossbow,

00:47:22.473 --> 00:47:23.213
like shooting,

00:47:23.233 --> 00:47:23.894
etc.

00:47:26.294 --> 00:47:34.321
And then the buildings will therefore interest real estate companies to turn them into apartments in the woods.

00:47:34.661 --> 00:47:37.123
And I think there were roughly

00:47:37.623 --> 00:47:43.088
100 million will be spent to renovate nearly 300 apartments.

00:47:43.728 --> 00:47:44.989
Can you imagine?

00:47:48.532 --> 00:47:49.293
Like in the ad.

00:47:49.294 --> 00:47:52.495
Do you see what I mean?

00:47:54.857 --> 00:47:55.498
But why not?

00:47:56.154 --> 00:47:56.654
Why not ?

00:47:56.935 --> 00:47:58.275
It's wonderful.

00:47:58.435 --> 00:47:59.536
A kind of pride,

00:48:00.897 --> 00:48:01.598
a source of pride.

00:48:03.679 --> 00:48:04.619
And as Dany said,

00:48:06.881 --> 00:48:08.622
It's wonderful because it's...

00:48:10.863 --> 00:48:11.464
Our parents,

00:48:11.584 --> 00:48:12.104
our dad,

00:48:12.304 --> 00:48:14.986
Our mother lives within us.

00:48:15.706 --> 00:48:16.206
And then,

00:48:17.428 --> 00:48:18.368
It has materialized.

00:48:19.989 --> 00:48:20.770
I think it's good.

00:48:21.770 --> 00:48:22.270
I think.

00:48:23.070 --> 00:48:24.931
Without that,
it would have completely fallen into ruin.

00:48:25.851 --> 00:48:26.791
It was already in ruins.

00:48:27.992 --> 00:48:30.232
I hope they're not collecting all of that with a wheelbarrow.

00:48:30.292 --> 00:48:33.093
because it will take a while.

00:48:35.014 --> 00:48:37.314
I'm glad it wasn't demolished.

00:48:37.594 --> 00:48:38.134
and at the same time,

00:48:38.154 --> 00:48:41.135
I'm happy because the site is listed.

00:48:41.715 --> 00:48:44.636
So they are obliged to respect many things.

00:48:45.296 --> 00:48:45.936
And that,

00:48:46.977 --> 00:48:47.717
I'm proud of it.

00:48:47.777 --> 00:48:51.358
because there is a trace of my dad that will remain there.

00:48:55.022 --> 00:48:58.824
And it's a rehabilitation that I find very interesting.

00:48:59.384 --> 00:49:03.027
And I think these buildings are part of our heritage.

00:49:03.567 --> 00:49:04.327
of rocasm,

00:49:04.567 --> 00:49:05.228
That's for sure.

00:49:05.668 --> 00:49:09.350
but also part of France's heritage.

00:49:09.670 --> 00:49:12.452
And it's great to be able to transform it on the other side.

00:49:12.972 --> 00:49:15.253
It has nonetheless been useful in the lives of many people.

00:49:15.413 --> 00:49:16.174
Unfortunately, too.

00:49:16.194 --> 00:49:17.455
Many people have died.

00:49:17.495 --> 00:49:23.478
But he played a part in history and I think it's great that there's a new life to it.

00:49:23.638 --> 00:49:23.959
In Paris,

00:49:23.959 --> 00:49:26.019
There are many buildings that used to be clinics.

00:49:26.079 --> 00:49:29.200
places where many people died,

00:49:29.220 --> 00:49:30.140
where many things happened,

00:49:30.360 --> 00:49:31.900
and in many places in France as well.

00:49:32.360 --> 00:49:32.762
And today,

00:49:32.762 --> 00:49:35.821
It is used in a completely different way and nobody has a problem with it.

00:49:36.081 --> 00:49:37.202
I'm not very sensitive.

00:49:37.242 --> 00:49:42.063
But it should have been demolished and then maybe trees replanted.

00:49:43.804 --> 00:49:44.724
to be modern.

00:49:45.044 --> 00:49:50.105
We have no regrets because we came here enough times to experience what we did.

00:49:50.766 --> 00:49:52.066
even if it was very little.

00:49:53.147 --> 00:49:59.732
and also enjoy the setting and a little bit of that atmosphere.

00:49:59.832 --> 00:50:01.734
It's true that it's a bit sad to see him in this state.

00:50:02.254 --> 00:50:02.754
It's going to be good.

00:50:03.015 --> 00:50:03.856
It will be restored.

00:50:04.696 --> 00:50:06.698
But me,

00:50:06.758 --> 00:50:07.659
I like it when it's like that.

00:50:08.980 --> 00:50:11.902
The squatting aspect,

00:50:11.942 --> 00:50:12.442
the side...

00:50:13.624 --> 00:50:15.225
We feel full of freedom.

00:50:16.026 --> 00:50:16.906
That's what's interesting.

00:50:17.147 --> 00:50:17.987
I am very,

00:50:18.027 --> 00:50:18.668
very sad.

00:50:19.408 --> 00:50:21.070
It's a place I really like.

00:50:24.359 --> 00:50:25.020
I know,

00:50:25.021 --> 00:50:26.141
I think I know it by heart.

00:50:26.861 --> 00:50:28.222
So we had to do it over a long period.

00:50:28.342 --> 00:50:28.722
wide,

00:50:28.722 --> 00:50:29.363
across.

00:50:32.024 --> 00:50:32.805
At least today,

00:50:33.245 --> 00:50:33.806
This is the last time.

00:50:33.807 --> 00:50:34.446
I know this is the last time

00:50:34.446 --> 00:50:35.247
Once I set foot there,

00:50:36.648 --> 00:50:39.089
It makes me nostalgic.

00:50:40.330 --> 00:50:42.712
The only thing that can disappoint me right now,

00:50:43.432 --> 00:50:45.054
It's about seeing the state of this room.

00:50:46.074 --> 00:50:48.396
To see that it has been cleared,

00:50:48.397 --> 00:50:49.277
That's not a problem.

00:50:49.917 --> 00:50:52.219
but to see that our platform is no longer there,

00:50:53.039 --> 00:50:54.760
That's a shame.

00:50:54.780 --> 00:50:55.881
There,
that's the regret,

00:50:55.941 --> 00:50:56.602
It hurts a little.

00:50:56.642 --> 00:50:58.963
You thought she'd still be here,

00:50:58.964 --> 00:51:01.205
Could you explain?

00:51:01.525 --> 00:51:02.025
That's it.

00:51:04.126 --> 00:51:06.647
To get on it or even just to see it again,

00:51:07.148 --> 00:51:08.228
to see her one last time,

00:51:08.348 --> 00:51:11.170
Because this will be the last time I come here.

00:51:11.910 --> 00:51:15.352
And afterwards I don't even think I know what will become of this room.

00:51:17.914 --> 00:51:18.734
And I don't want to know.

00:51:19.955 --> 00:51:22.356
I want it to stay the way it is.

00:51:23.257 --> 00:51:24.597
Even the image there is way too much.

